{% comment %}
  The four large cards of a mega menu's "Featured" tab: two pictures and two videos, in a
  single row. Unlike the other tabs, which list collections as small tiles, this one is
  editorial - each card is a piece of art with one line of copy over it.

  Accepts:
  - parent: {String} the top-level item's title, e.g. "Engagement"

  Outputs one card per entry, separated by "~", each in this shape:

      Caption|url|picture|video

  - picture is a file under assets/. It is the card's image, and for a card that has a video
    it is also the still shown before the video starts, so it should be a frame from it.
  - video is optional, and names a file uploaded in Shopify admin under Content > Files.
    A card with no video is just the picture. Anything ending .mp4 or .webm plays muted and
    looping, with a pause button, and never plays for a visitor who has asked for reduced
    motion.

  The videos are NOT in this theme: a theme is capped at 50MB and these run 10-16MB each.
  Upload them under Content > Files with exactly the names below and they appear here. Until
  then each card falls back to its picture, so the menu looks finished either way.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  PLACEHOLDERS - the pictures are MiaDonna's, kept only until the shop has its
  own. Swap the file under assets/ to change a card; the name stays the same.
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign parent_key = parent | handle

  case parent_key
    when 'engagement'
      echo 'The Value Edit|/collections/ready-to-ship|featured-engagement-value.jpg|'
      echo '~Shop Signature Engagement|/collections/engagement-rings|featured-engagement-signature.jpg|featured-engagement-signature.mp4'
      echo '~New Engagement Arrivals|/collections/new-in|featured-engagement-new.jpg|featured-engagement-new.mp4'
      echo '~Shop Bridal Sets|/collections/bridal-sets|featured-engagement-bridal.jpg|'
    when 'wedding'
      echo "Shop Men's Wedding Bands|/collections/mens-rings|featured-wedding-mens.jpg|"
      echo '~The Eternity Collection|/collections/eternity-rings|featured-wedding-eternity.jpg|featured-wedding-eternity.mp4'
      echo '~New Wedding Arrivals|/collections/new-in|featured-wedding-new.jpg|featured-wedding-new.mp4'
      echo '~Shop Anniversary Rings|/collections/anniversary-rings|featured-wedding-anniversary.jpg|'
    when 'jewellery'
      echo 'Shop Signature Earrings|/collections/signature-earrings|featured-jewellery-earrings.jpg|'
      echo '~Shop Must-Have Studs|/collections/studs|featured-jewellery-studs.jpg|featured-jewellery-studs.mp4'
      echo '~Shop Tennis Bracelets|/collections/tennis-bracelets|featured-jewellery-bracelets.jpg|featured-jewellery-bracelets.mp4'
      echo '~Shop Signature Necklaces|/collections/signature-necklaces|featured-jewellery-necklaces.jpg|'
  endcase
-%}
